{"availability":"available","full":"matata86/fns-floorplan","name":"fns-floorplan","description":"Animated 2D floor plan for Home Assistant with a built-in editor: lights, doors, windows, sensors, robot vacuum, room panel. Inspired by NeonPlan 3D. HACS, EN/CS/DE.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-06T19:10:38Z","updated":"2026-10-08T07:33:06Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://matata86.github.io/fns-floorplan/","topics":["floorplan","hacs","hacs-integration","home-assistant","lovelace"],"demo":"https://matata86.github.io/fns-floorplan/demo/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:25.943Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:25.943Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:25.943Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:35:25.943Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An animated 2D floor plan for Home Assistant that shows the live state of your home: lights glowing in their colour, doors and windows swinging open, motion ripples, water leaks, a robot vacuum driving through the room it reports, appliances with animated icons, an alarm that tints the whole flat when triggered, media players with the playing title, cameras, free text items and room climate. You draw the plan in a built-in editor, no YAML needed.","Inspired by NeonPlan 3D, a 3D floor plan card for Home Assistant. FNS Floorplan takes the idea to an animated 2D plan with its own editor, and a NeonPlan 3D building can be imported (see Quick start).","Live demo (the real card with fake states, no Home Assistant needed)"],"features":["Lights follow their colour or colour temperature, brightness scales the glow; LED strips glow in the real colour of the light.","Doors and windows with a contact sensor swing open and pulse for a few seconds after opening; blinds and locks are drawn at the opening.","Motion, occupancy and presence sensors send out ripples, moisture sensors pulse a water leak chip.","Appliances with animated icons: fan, air purifier, dishwasher, dryer, boiler, radiator, aquarium, fireplace, fridge, camera, lock, alarm, media player, and \"other device\" that behaves by the domain of its entity.","Several floors with floor tabs, day / night look (by the sun or by the Home Assistant theme), automatic rotation on narrow screens."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matata86/fns-floorplan/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"5b99d897ca702d53ce13d0d1f9aaa114e9865b8a92044d08c62c7e471fe84441","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:26.149Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:26.149Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An animated 2D floor plan for Home Assistant that shows the live state of your home: lights glowing in their colour, doors and windows swinging open, motion ripples, water leaks, a robot vacuum driving through the room it reports, appliances with animated icons, an alarm that tints the whole flat when triggered, media players with the playing title, cameras, free text items and room climate. You draw the plan in a built-in editor, no YAML needed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matata86/fns-floorplan/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"5b99d897ca702d53ce13d0d1f9aaa114e9865b8a92044d08c62c7e471fe84441","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matata86/fns-floorplan/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:26.150Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T07:33:06Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/matata86/fns-floorplan/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:26.150Z","hash":"5b99d897ca702d53ce13d0d1f9aaa114e9865b8a92044d08c62c7e471fe84441","originalBytes":11014,"storedBytes":11014,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["plan","home","assistant","fns","room","floorplan","floor","lights","open","text","auto","doors","label","add","card","editor","entity","sensors","yaml","day","save","temperature","animated